  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Phuket Smart City Technical Assistance, through Winbourne Consulting, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Thailand&apos;s Digital Economy and Promotion Agency (DEPA) is funding technical assistance that will provide a roadmap to support the implementation of ICT infrastructure necessary for buildout of smart city projects in Phuket Province, Thailand. USTDA&apos;s grant will enable expansion of functionality for the Phuket City Data Platform; upgrade of Phuket Province&apos;s command center capabilities to improve city services and emergency communications systems; and modernization of core ICT infrastructure, including fiberoptic networks, data servers, cloud migration, cybersecurity, and 5G deployment.</narrative>
  </description>
